{"ref":"BDB, נְקֵבָה","hw":"נְקֵבָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נְקֵבָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. female (</strong><em>perforata</em> (Ba<sup>NB 166</sup>); so Thes and most; > another view in Schwally<sup> ZAW xi (1891), 181 f.; Idiot. 57</sup>; NH = BH; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">נוּקְבָּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נוּקְבְּתָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܶܩܒܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܢܶܩܒܬܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.22\">Je 31:22</a> + 21 times (all Pent., and all P except <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.16\">Dt 4:16</a>):<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>woman</em> (or female child) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.22\">Je 31:22</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּבֶר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:27\" href=\"/Genesis.1.27\">Gn 1:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:2\" href=\"/Genesis.5.2\">5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.5\">Lv 12:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 12:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.12.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.33\">15:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.4\">27:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 27:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.27.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:3\" href=\"/Numbers.5.3\">Nu 5:3</a> (all opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָכָר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:15\" href=\"/Numbers.31.15\">Nu 31:15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>female animal</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:19\" href=\"/Genesis.6.19\">Gn 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:3\" href=\"/Genesis.7.3\">7:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:9\" href=\"/Genesis.7.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:16\" href=\"/Genesis.7.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.1\">Lv 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.6\">6</a> (all opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָכָר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.28\">4:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:32\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:6\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.6\">5:6</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.16\">Dt 4:16</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">זָכָר</span>) may include both women and animals.","next":"BDB, מַקֶּ֫בֶת²","prev":"BDB, נֶ֫קֶב²"}